     activating the area for one day with no schedule; its CORRECTION (sequence 2, correction 1)
     ending the activation two hours earlier; and a PERMDELTA (sequence 3) at an instant, renaming
     the area and withdrawing its localType with xsi:nil (Temporality Concept 1.1 §4.4.6.1). No
     slice states geometry: under a delta an absent property is UNCHANGED, and no PlanObject is
     drawn from what a slice does not state. -->
